  "title": "Beyond Clinical Success: Bianca Gustafson on Building Supply Chains That Scale",
  "summary": "In a recent Contract Pharma interview, Bianca Gustafson, Senior Director of Program Management at Cryoport Systems, shared an important perspective on the transition from clinical development to commercialization. According to Gustafson, a common mistake organizations make is assuming that commercial readiness is an extension of clinical operations, when actually commercialization requires a full-on shift in how supply chains are designed and scaled.",
